WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.367
At this point we have four core collection types.

00:00:03.367 --> 00:00:07.317
Use a list when order matters and duplicates are allowed.

00:00:07.317 --> 00:00:09.987
Use a tuple for a fixed record.

00:00:09.987 --> 00:00:13.777
Use a dictionary when values need meaningful labels.

00:00:13.777 --> 00:00:17.533
Use a set when you need uniqueness or group comparison.

00:00:17.983 --> 00:00:20.845
The goal is not to memorize a rigid rule.

00:00:20.845 --> 00:00:24.255
Ask how the data will be accessed and changed.

00:00:24.255 --> 00:00:27.131
That usually points you toward the right structure.
